===Etymology=== 
Via {{etyl|de|en}}; the name was used by Ptolemy<ref>Ptolemy - Geographia</ref>, but is of uncertain origin.  {{etyl|xil|en}} has been suggested.<ref> Room, Adrian, Place Names of the World, 2nd ed., McFarland & Co., 2006. </ref>

